node_modules/

# Preview harness artifacts — regenerated by `npm run trim` / `npm run capture`
preview/prices-trim.csv
preview/shots/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Workbook build intermediate — regenerated by `node build_workbook.mjs` in ~40s.
